    "title": "horsegiirL Is Going on Tour This Fall - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kiana Mickles ,\n10 hours ago In support of her debut album, Nature Is Healing, self-described “half-horse, half-human” producer and DJ horsegiirL will launch a world tour this fall. She’ll start the trek in North America, stopping in Denver, New York, Los Angeles, Atlanta, and more along the way. By November, she’ll head across the pond, returning to her stomping grounds in Berlin before trotting over to Paris, Amsterdam, London, and Antwerp. Check out the full itinerary below. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
